  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EmpowerHER: Advancing Digital and Economic Empowerment of Women in Turkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project empowers women and marginalised groups in Turkiye by enhancing digital skills, fostering career advancement, and promoting inclusion in the tech sector. It aims to combat cyberbullying, strengthen social cohesion, and support equitable participation in the digital economy.</narrative>
  </description>
